# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/AC1.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Side passages off Squirrel Rift
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Saturday 19th November.
# Andy Cave, Alex Gee & Ros Bateman - 3 / 12 / 94 (called 'A' in notes)
# Data entry: Tim Long

survey ac1

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

# End: 60' up in big rift passage below where we saw Pete (Haggis Basher)

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	12.9	10	+25	# rift traverse (high!)

  1a	1b	6.0	14	0	# ends dig probably back to HB
  1b	2	3.2	294	0
  2	3	10.0	8	0
  3	4	7.7	284	0	# climb down connects to A1
  # after possible route to HB
  4a	4b	5.7	24	0	# station is previously surveyed
  # rift (unlabeled station) I think
  # just above 1st climb down in
  # connection to FAB
  4b	4	3.4	14	0
  4	5	3.5	336	0

  5a	5	4.2	210	0	# ends dig
  5	6	9.9	350	0	# squeeze
  6	7	4.0	0	0
  7	8	1.7	332	0
  8	9	3.2	302	0

  9a	9	7.6	12	0	# ends dig
  9	10	7.5	2	-30
  10	11	3.2	358	0	# unnumbered by Sue M's junction
  # (see sketch )

endcentreline
endsurvey
